\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Median reliance on the cue through the true logit and through SAE latents as the projection strength $\gamma $ grows, over development trap fits. The gap is carried by the SAE error term; at high $\gamma $ the refit probe compensates. The shipped v3 traps additionally carry an adversarial decoy edit, and they are engineered: this figure is not evidence about how often SAEs mislead in natural audits.}}{15}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:trap}{{6}{15}{Median reliance on the cue through the true logit and through SAE latents as the projection strength $\gamma $ grows, over development trap fits. The gap is carried by the SAE error term; at high $\gamma $ the refit probe compensates. The shipped v3 traps additionally carry an adversarial decoy edit, and they are engineered: this figure is not evidence about how often SAEs mislead in natural audits}{figure.6}{}}
